--TEST--
The attribute name of `Filter::equals` and `Filter::present` is sent as it is written, so a `tainted` one does not compile — ADR 0278 § 5 and `rule:security/tainted-qualifier`
--FILE--
<?nvs
tainted string $attribute = "cn";
var $equal = Core\Ldap\Filter::equals($attribute, "Staff");
var $present = Core\Ldap\Filter::present($attribute);
--EXPECT--

